!
!   Backup (AD=10, installed when primary track goes down):
!   ip route 0.0.0.0/0 10.0.2.2 10
!
! TODO: Step 2 - IP SLA probe
!
!   ip sla 1
!    icmp-echo 10.99.0.1 source-interface Ethernet1
!    frequency 5
!   ip sla schedule 1 life forever start-time now
!
! TODO: Step 3 - Track object
!
!   track 1 ip sla 1 reachability
!
! NOTES:
!   - AD=5 is lower than connected (0) default? No — static default is 1 normally.
!     Using AD=5 vs AD=10 makes primary preferred over backup.
